flowchart TD
    A([Tenant successfully provisioned])
    --> B[Company automatically created]

    B --> C[Company status = PENDING]

    C --> D[Complete Company Information]

    D --> E[Configure Locations]

    E --> F[Configure Departments]

    F --> G[Configure Grades]

    G --> H[Configure Job Titles]

    H --> I[Configure Roles]

    I --> J[Import Employees]

    J --> K[Configure Organization Responsibilities / PoC]

    K --> L{All mandatory setup<br/>steps completed?}

    L -->|No| M[Company remains PENDING]

    M --> N[Administrator completes<br/>missing setup]

    N --> L

    L -->|Yes| O[Activation becomes available]

    O --> P[Administrator selects<br/>Activate Company]

    P --> Q{Final validation successful?}

    Q -->|No| M

    Q -->|Yes| R[Company status = ACTIVE]

    R --> S([Company operational])